Method attribution
------------------
The grid system documented in this plugin is attributed to Josef Müller-Brockmann's
"Grid systems in graphic design" (Niggli Verlag, 1981; Chinese edition published by
Shanghai People's Fine Arts Publishing House, 2016). This project is an independent
summary, methodology reference and rendering toolchain. It is not affiliated with,
sponsored or endorsed by the author, the publisher, or the rights holders.

No pages, scans, figures or long excerpts from the book are redistributed. The
reference documents are original summaries and parameter tables derived from the
publicly known method, plus this project's own engineering notes.

Example content
---------------
The example exhibition ("SYNTHETIC NATURE" / 合成自然), its dates, institutions,
curators, artists and URLs are fictional and are provided to demonstrate the
layout method only.

Fonts
-----
No font software is distributed with this package. The toolchain references the
fonts installed on the user's machine (for example Microsoft YaHei, Noto Sans SC,
Source Han Sans, Arial) only as font-family names and documentation examples.
The example preview image was rendered with fonts installed on the build machine;
obtaining the necessary licences for any proprietary font is the user's
responsibility.

